  "steps": [
    "Put the oil in a large pan and fry the onion and carrots over a low heat for 4–5 minutes until translucent and soft.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and fry for 1 minute until fragrant, then add the curry powder and cook, stirring regularly, for 1 minute.",
    "Add the bouillon powder, soy sauce and boiling water. Bring to the boil, add the noodles and cook for 5–8 minutes until tender.",
    "Sprinkle with spring onions, coriander and beansprouts if using, and serve."
  ],
  "notes": "Inspired by Japanese katsu curry. Use any dried noodles — ramen, udon or rice noodles all work well."
}
